  "vibe": "A late-shift reading room in forest green (#223828) and lamp-warm paper (#f2ecdc), with rust-red spines (#a8402e) and oak (#8a6a42) doing all the pointing. EB Garamond sets titles in a genuine book serif at 92–142px; Public Sans keeps the ledgers plain. Behind the type, two oak rails carry thirty-two book spines — varied heights, thin paper banding, one in seven leaning — under a banker's lamp whose bulb breathes on sin(2t) and throws an 8%-opacity cone of #f6e6b0 light that ten dust motes fall through. Cards are cream paper with a green keyline and zero tilt: catalogue discipline, not scrapbook. The camera drifts 4px and rolls a third of a degree; titles settle on drowse. It owns a typed catalogue card, a stacking returns trolley, a closing-rounds checklist and side-sliding desk notices.",
